<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was slow in the Panhandle area late Friday. Limited test of slaughter steers closed steady, heifers not tested.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers. Sales reported on 800 slaughter steers and no heifers following the weekly movement of 91,200 head.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3 1150-1200 lbs 67.00.</p>
</text>
